---
arrangement: cli-plan-summary-line
envelope: stderr
owns:
  - cli-why-pointer-line
  - cli-decision-digest-line
edit-loop: edit a sentence in the transcript below, then run `mise run loom:compile -- cli-plan-summary-line && mise run loom:promote -- cli-plan-summary-line`. `mise run loom:vars -- --all cli-plan-summary-line` lists this case's values; type {{name}} to insert or move one.
---
-- webhost.sh --
#!/bin/sh
set -eu
apt-get update
cp ./nginx.conf /etc/nginx/nginx.conf
hork tune --profile web

-- replay --
$ dorc plan --book=webhost.sh
dorc: run `dorc why` for the per-site cause-chains, or `dorc why webhost.sh:N` to query a source line
dorc: plan-summary sites=4 elide=0 omit=0 guard=0 run=4 may-alias=0
dorc: decision-digest c9e4bd60d91edbc2
